---
import Layout from "@/layouts/main.astro"
import { Header } from "@/components/Header"
import { Footer } from "@/components/Footer"
import { EmailCopyButton } from "@/components/EmailCopyButton"

const email = "info@willitgrain.com"
---

<Layout lang="en" title="About | WILLIT GRAIN">
  <Header lang="en" isAboutPage client:load />

  <main class="relative z-10 flex flex-col w-full min-h-screen pt-28 md:pt-32 pb-24 text-white px-4 md:px-8 xl:px-12 mx-auto max-w-[1200px] gap-8 md:gap-12">

    <!-- Company Description -->
    <section class="border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 animate-fade-up">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 md:mb-8 drop-shadow-lg">WILLIT GRAIN</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-sm md:text-lg text-white/80 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
        <p>
develops feature films with an European perspective: character-driven genre and specialty cinema that both entertains and moves audiences. Our focus is on characters who defy the boundaries imposed upon them. Our stories aim to achieve the highest duality of filmmaking – unapologetically entertain audiences while handling profound themes.
        </p>
        <p>
The company was founded near Munich by Leopold Schraudolph and Finn-Oliver Walter, who are producing together since 2022.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Profiles -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8 animate-fade-up delay-300">

      <!-- Leopold -->
      <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
        <div class="aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/porträts/leopold-schraudolph.webp"
            alt="Leopold Schraudolph"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-4 flex-1">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl drop-shadow-lg">Leopold Schraudolph</h3>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
was born and raised in Singapore before moving to Europe in 2021. He studied film production in the dual system, supported by scholarships from the German Academic Scholarship Foundation (Studienstiftung) and the Bavarian Elite Development Program (Max Weber Programm). He has worked at production companies in Munich and Paris. He has written and directed eleven award-winning short films screened internationally, often exploring people who dream.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Finn-Oliver -->
      <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
        <div class="aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/porträts/finn-oliver-walter.webp"
            alt="Finn-Oliver Walter"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-4 flex-1">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl drop-shadow-lg">Finn-Oliver Walter</h3>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
grew up near Munich and has produced his own and commissioned projects for years. During his dual studies in production, he gained valuable experience at Wiedemann&Berg. Since 2025, he is specializing in “International Producing” at the Filmakademie Baden-Württemberg. He views the production process as the art of bringing together artistic visions, teams and resources to create a viable production as a whole.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section class="border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 animate-fade-up delay-500">
      <h3 class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 mb-6 font-semibold">
        Get in touch
      </h3>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <EmailCopyButton email={email} client:load />

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
          <a
            href="https://www.crew-united.com/de/Willit-Grain-Schraudolph-Gaudenz-Leopold-Walter-Finn-Oliver-GbR-de_740708.html"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] md:text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-all backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/30 px-4 md:px-5 py-2.5 md:py-3 rounded-full"
          >
            <img
              src="/logos/crew-united.svg"
              alt=""
              class="h-4 md:h-5 w-auto brightness-0 invert opacity-80"
            />
            Crew United ↗
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://www.instagram.com/willitgrain/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] md:text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-all backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/30 px-4 md:px-5 py-2.5 md:py-3 rounded-full"
            aria-label="Instagram"
          >
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="16" height="16"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5" />
              <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z" />
              <line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5" />
            </svg>
            Instagram ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer lang="en" client:load />
</Layout>
